        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen cupboard, front profile metal, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen cupboard, front profile metal, at plant
na;
UUID: 79a74d0a-1225-38ba-8f93-63fb3832e778
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards and the front cover (steel cover) per m3. The inventory bases on a kitchen with a cupboard volume of 3.36 m3. Screws and hinges are considered proportionally. The countertop, sink, waste system and cooker hood are not included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
